# Only theories, ROOT/ROOTS files and LaTeX document sources are versioned.
# Everything else (generated code, zips, python, drivers, tests, benchmarks,
# planning notes, build output) stays local.
*
!*/
!*.thy
!ROOT
!ROOTS
!**/document/**
!.gitignore

# editor backups and scratch
*.thy~
ROOT~
ROOTS~
Scratch.thy
